{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes Untold is a cinematic third-person action-adventure with a strong focus on traversal, movement flow, and time manipulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone traveler exploring large, surreal environments where the world is unstable. Platforms collapse, paths shift, and hesitation is punished. To move forward, you must slow time, read the environment, and commit to precise movement through spaces that constantly change around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not a traditional puzzle game.</strong> Most challenges are solved through movement, not menus or logic grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traversal Comes First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of Echoes Untold is momentum-based traversal. Progress is built around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long jumps across collapsing architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical spaces that reward timing and commitment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ledge grabs and recovery that keep movement fluid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sequences designed to be played in motion, not stopped and reset</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy third-person games where traversal and environment navigation are the main challenge, this experience is built around that mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Manipulation as a Movement Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowing time is not a rewind or undo mechanic. It is used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross fast-moving or collapsing platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React during high-speed traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain jumps and mid-air movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read dangerous spaces before committing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once time resumes, the world continues \u2014 mistakes included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world actively pushes back. Environmental hazards and hostile forces exist to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break safe routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrupt movement flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force fast decisions under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are designed to create tension during traversal, not to turn the game into a combat-focused experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Minimal, Atmospheric Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes Untold tells its story quietly. There are no long cutscenes or heavy dialogue systems. Narrative is delivered through environment design, visual traces, and distant echoes and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic third-person action-adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong focus on traversal and movement flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time manipulation used as an active gameplay tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical level design and collapsing environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, minimal storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with controller</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ff0d1bd9e15a5fdb2aba3902983d3a2b.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ff0d1bd9e15a5fdb2aba3902983d3a2b.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ff0d1bd9e15a5fdb2aba3902983d3a2b.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/03c12354c60120db27db289e74864df6.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1560 height=463 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822650?t=1767628860","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/3cbd8276c8be3c2a628b7f7af690fe568db7d71f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767628860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/6a224ce67ca7ad426035cfc0c8d2246242a59616/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767628860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/6a224ce67ca7ad426035cfc0c8d2246242a59616/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767628860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains no explicit sexual content, violence, or disturbing imagery. It features emotionally reflective and philosophical dialogue, but nothing considered mature or graphic."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4101810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes Untold is a cinematic third-person action-adventure with a strong focus on traversal, movement flow, and time manipulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0623844d67041e2d191ae90dfb07fa5f.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone traveler exploring large, surreal environments where the world is unstable. Platforms collapse, paths shift, and hesitation is punished. To move forward, you must slow time, read the environment, and commit to precise movement through spaces that constantly change around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/929e9e117aebc399abd673d6c5cf5228.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not a traditional puzzle game.</strong> Most challenges are solved through movement, not menus or logic grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b86634a66f735f2b25cc2c9064ca8b8e.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traversal Comes First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of Echoes Untold is momentum-based traversal. Progress is built around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long jumps across collapsing architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical spaces that reward timing and commitment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ledge grabs and recovery that keep movement fluid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sequences designed to be played in motion, not stopped and reset</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy third-person games where traversal and environment navigation are the main challenge, this experience is built around that mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/ca2e1afe436a6d1dc9c185ed4b7c661f.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Manipulation as a Movement Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowing time is not a rewind or undo mechanic. It is used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross fast-moving or collapsing platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React during high-speed traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain jumps and mid-air movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read dangerous spaces before committing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once time resumes, the world continues \u2014 mistakes included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/b94a2cb5be92f64b7917a3c24b8f0b14.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world actively pushes back. Environmental hazards and hostile forces exist to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break safe routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrupt movement flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force fast decisions under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are designed to create tension during traversal, not to turn the game into a combat-focused experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/957f32cf880376408c0dfda0ca094e1c.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Minimal, Atmospheric Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes Untold tells its story quietly. There are no long cutscenes or heavy dialogue systems. Narrative is delivered through environment design, visual traces, and distant echoes and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.poster.avif?t=1767628860\" width=1080 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.webm?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822650/extras/0101e29928cb6a1db184bca3dd6f299a.mp4?t=1767628860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic third-person action-adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong focus on traversal and movement flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time manipulation used as an active gameplay tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical level design and collapsing environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, minimal storytelling</p></li><